{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/826339-translation-guides","id":826339,"title":"Translation Guides?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-02-08T15:40:49-08:00","id":826339,"title":"Translation Guides?","content":"We have the Vampire Translation guide, the Werewolf Translation guide, the Mage Translation guide, and even a Demon Translation guide. I believe there is to be a Changeling Translation guide, but that may be wishful thinking on my part. Has any body heard if there is to be a generic Translation guide for the games that do not match up 1-to-1?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Yes, yes, yes... I know it is a horror game.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11143-feonorx","name":"Feonorx","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"79"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-08T16:48:14-08:00","id":826385,"title":"","content":"All of the translation guides ported one game line to its corespondent new line , since there was no &quot;generic&quot; old world of darkness setting why would a translation guide be needed?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3953-dwight","name":"Dwight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3953_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2355"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-08T16:51:02-08:00","id":826387,"title":"","content":"Changeling doesn't have a Translation Guide, and I'm not honestly sure if one makes sense.<br /> <br /> There's no equivalent game for Wraith in the CofD, but Hunter should go off fairly easily if such a book were to be done; the Imbued would honestly just make a fairly simple Conspiracy, while everything from Vigil works in the Hunters Hunted context. Kindred of the East has no analogue and doesn't honestly deserve one. I think Mummy is too niche, which breaks my heart. Am I missing anything?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-08T17:49:27-08:00","id":826421,"title":"","content":"You are thinking WoD to CofD, but what about the other way? Promethean, Geist, etc brought into the WoD? That would be fun... And one book with a chapter to each one and there you go....<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Yes, yes, yes... I know it is a horror game.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11143-feonorx","name":"Feonorx","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"79"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-08T18:44:30-08:00","id":826450,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/826339-translation-guides?p=826387#post826387\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Changeling doesn't have a Translation Guide, and I'm not honestly sure if one makes sense.<br /> <br /> There's no equivalent game for Wraith in the CofD, but Hunter should go off fairly easily if such a book were to be done; the Imbued would honestly just make a fairly simple Conspiracy, while everything from Vigil works in the Hunters Hunted context. <b>Kindred of the East has no analogue</b> and doesn't honestly deserve one. I think Mummy is too niche, which breaks my heart. Am I missing anything?</div> </div> </div> </div>It sort of does with Promethean, at least with respect to power themes. Both games use a setup from a take on alchemy, in this case Hermetic vs. Corrupted, Death-oriented Daoist. It'd be interesting to see powers based off of the other principle, even if the rest of the games don't quite mesh as well.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-19T17:35:17-07:00","id":868920,"title":"","content":"Could see a hunter translation guide working more for hunters hunted, Hellfire clubs, like Ashwood Abbey, should exist in CWOD<br /> <br /> and tactics are cool....","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-22T00:40:46-07:00","id":871024,"title":"","content":"A Changeling Translation Guide wouldn't be any harder than the Demon Translation Guide was. That said, I don't see any more Translation Guides happening; not with the current efforts being focused on distinguishing the Chronicles of Darkness from the World of Darkness.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/memb